{
  "message": "I will compute the 2005-to-2006 change in the product warranty reserve from the roll-forward components disclosed for 2006: add 2006 pretax warranty charges of $4 million, subtract 2006 cash outlays of $5 million, and add $7 million of warranty obligations assumed in acquisitions. This yields the net change in the reserve; the disclosed beginning and ending reserves are used only as a consistency check.",
